  "details": "When I preload a wold and drop a portal. It waits to load in the portal locally until the preload is done. For everyone else the portal loads immediately. \n\nI would expect that the portal would load at the same time as the preload is going on, so I can enter it and continue the download in the loading screen. Instead of waiting while everybody else can enter it.\n\nTo reproduce I just click preload on a larger world so that I have time. Drop a portal. And then wait for the preload to be done to see the portal.\n\nI've added a video showing the moment when the preload is done.",
